Package: ziti-edge-tunnel-gui
Version: @VERSION@-@RELEASE@
Architecture: all
Maintainer: @MAINTAINER@
Section: net
Priority: optional
Depends: python3 (>= 3.8), python3-pyqt6 | python3-pyqt5, pkexec | policykit-1, systemd
Recommends: ziti-edge-tunnel, python3-qrcode
Suggests: gnome-shell-extension-appindicator
Homepage: https://github.com/HomelabEngineer/openziti-desktop-edge-linux
Description: Ziti Desktop Edge - GUI for the OpenZiti ziti-edge-tunnel service
 A system-tray desktop client with the same interface as Ziti Desktop Edge
 for Windows and Android. It controls the existing ziti-edge-tunnel systemd
 service (connect, disconnect, restart, start at boot) and talks to it over
 its IPC sockets to add and remove identities, toggle them, handle MFA and
 external sign-in, list services, change the log level and edit the tunnel
 configuration. The tunneler itself is not included; install it from the
 OpenZiti package repository.
